      "writtenOn": "2026-01-16T18:59:52Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This isn\u0027t really new validation. It\u0027s a minor refactoring of the existing validation logic in [3] to handle the fact that implicitSampleCount is declared at the pass level instead of the attachment level now.\n\nThe existing tests in MultisampledRenderingTests.cpp have been modified to use the new structure, but other than one check that no longer applied they were already providing the appropriate coverage.\n\n(Note that this change doesn\u0027t retain tests for the old struct, which is still present for migration purposes. My plan is to remove them almost immediately once Skia has been updated, however, so I didn\u0027t see that as problematic.)",
